  "rule_order": [
    "Quarantine known failed component qualification; unapproved substitutions; failed post-repair/calibration checks; failed repairs reintroduced without acceptance checks; unresolved recurring faults; unknown history for safety-relevant or pressure-boundary parts; and unqualified battery or pressure-boundary fabrication.",
    "If a declared field-replaceable component requires destructive access, return redesign_for_serviceability unless a higher-priority quarantine condition exists. Serviceability target and safety criticality are separate fields.",
    "Return not_locally_reproducible when local_fabrication is requested but preferred editable source files are unavailable; this is a manufacturing-closure result, not a blanket judgement that a commercially supplied qualified part is unsafe.",
    "Hold for retest when required configuration records are stale or required post-repair checks are incomplete; hold for evidence when substitution/compatibility status is unknown.",
    "Return release_to_acceptance only when all declared gates are satisfied. This is not a product release or qualification."
  ],
